  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CB15311",
    "sub_id": "30315",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Class Participation 30% Final Report 70%</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "所有課程活動都將在同學之間的友好參與和互動氛圍中進行，彼此間尊重和欣賞每位同學的個人經歷、背景和觀點，如國內外各學制、多元入學及學習文化、性別等。希望您始終在本課程中應用最高的學術標準，並以有尊嚴和尊重的態度對待同學。",
    "course_pol_en": "All course activities will be carried out in an atmosphere of friendly participation and interaction among students, respecting and appreciating each student's personal experience, background and perspectives, such as various school systems at home and abroad, diverse enrollment and learning cultures, gender, etc. You are expected to apply the highest academic standards throughout this course and to treat fellow students with dignity and respect.",
    "course_rem": "在請益時間這個時段，我會在我的辦公室歡迎您，您也可以先預約。如果您有任何疑問或問題，請務必、盡快與我會面，以便我們一起妥善解決學習上的問題。也可以運用學校電子郵件與我聯繫，但我不會在晚上和休假日回覆您。許多問題最好親自處理，所以鼓勵您運用請益時間直接來，與我討論。",
    "course_rem_en": "I will welcome you in my office during this time of interest, or you can make an appointment first. If you have any questions or problems, please be sure to meet with me as soon as possible so that we can properly solve the learning problems together. Many issues are best handled in person, so I encourage you to take advantage of your time to come and discuss with me directly.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>剽竊是對學術信任的嚴重破壞。在學習作業中，我們的言論和想法就是我們作業的價值；因此將他人的作品當作自己的作品繳交，是一種盜竊行為。當您使用別人的文字和想法時，無論是著名作家還是同學的作品，而不註明這些文章、詞語和想法的來源出處，您的行為就是在抄襲。原創性作品是我的底線，抄襲的作品將會收到&ldquo;0&rdquo;或&ldquo;不及格&rdquo;的分數。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Plagiarism is a serious breach of academic trust. In schoolwork, our words and thoughts are the value of our work; so submitting someone else&#39;s work as our own is a form of theft. When you use someone else&#39;s words and ideas, whether by a famous author or a classmate, without acknowledging the source of those articles, words and ideas, you are plagiarizing. Original work is my bottom line, plagiarized work will receive a &quot;0&quot; or &quot;fail&quot; score.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": null
  },
